1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:11,080
The 4K restoration was undertaken by the Friedrich-Wilhelm-Murnau-Stiftung in Wiesbaden from the original camera negative held at the Bundesarchiv-Filmarchiv in Berlin .

2
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:19,390
The first reel of the camera negative is missing and was reconstituted using alternate sources . Jump cuts and missing frames in 67 shots were

3
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:27,700
reinserted from multiple prints . An original German release print does not exist . The basis for the colour tinting were two nitrate prints

4
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:36,010
from Latin America , wich represent the earliest surviving prints of the film , now stored at the Filmmuseum Dusseldorf and the Cineteca di

5
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:44,320
Bologna . The intertitles were recreated from the flashtitles in the camera negative and a 16mm print from 1935 from the

6
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:55,500
Deutsche Kinemathek-Museum fur Film und Fernsehen in Berlin . The digital image restoration was carried out by L 'Immagine Ritrovata - - Film Conservation and Restoration in Bologna .

7
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:07,640
The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari

8
00:01:07,810 --> 00:01:13,950
A Film in Six Acts Written by Carl Mayer and Hans Janowitz

9
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:21,200
Decla-Film-Gesellschaft Berlin

10
00:01:21,410 --> 00:01:26,540
Directed by Robert Wiene

11
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:36,760
Art Direction : Hermann Warm Walter Reimann , Walter Rohrig

12
00:01:36,970 --> 00:01:44,700
Cast : Werner Krauss Conrad Veidt , Friedrich Feher

13
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:16,400
Lil Dagover , Hans Heinz v. Twardowski , Rudolph Lettinger

14
00:02:16,510 --> 00:02:22,930
Photographed by Willy Hameister

15
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:26,550
The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari

16
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:29,940
ACT I

17
00:02:41,490 --> 00:02:45,160
There are spirits ... They are all around us ...

18
00:02:45,330 --> 00:03:00,010
They have driven me from hearth and home , from wife and child ...

19
00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:43,260
That is my fiancee ...

20
00:03:57,980 --> 00:04:10,580
What she and I have lived through is stranger still than what you have lived through ...

21
00:04:12,290 --> 00:04:18,590
I will tell you about it

22
00:04:25,340 --> 00:04:33,450
The little town where I was born ...

23
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:55,460
The annual fair

24
00:05:17,230 --> 00:05:21,300
Him ...

25
00:05:55,060 --> 00:06:01,560
Alan , my friend

26
00:07:17,430 --> 00:07:23,400
Special Edition : Fair In Holstenwall

27
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:29,150
For The First Time Entertainments of Every Variety

28
00:07:42,290 --> 00:07:49,590
Come on , Franzis , let 's go to the fair !

29
00:08:21,830 --> 00:08:33,590
Don 't go inside , the town clerk is in a vile temper today !

30
00:08:44,850 --> 00:08:48,650
Dr. Caligari

31
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:01,330
Wait !

32
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,980
Wait !

33
00:10:02,310 --> 00:10:16,530
I wish to apply for a permit to present my spectacle at the fair ...

34
00:10:20,450 --> 00:10:30,330
What kind of spectacle ?

35
00:10:32,540 --> 00:10:36,380
A somnambulist

36
00:13:09,780 --> 00:13:22,210
Step rrrrright up ! Presenting here for the first time ... Cesare , the Somnambulist !

37
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:33,900
END OF ACT I

38
00:13:34,350 --> 00:13:38,060
ACT II

39
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:48,320
That night the first in a series of mysterious crimes took place .

40
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:30,450
Murder ! The town clerk has been killed . Stabbed in the side with a strange pointed instrument ...

41
00:15:26,630 --> 00:15:52,350
Step rrrrright in ! Presenting here for the first time ... Cesare the Somnambulist !

42
00:15:52,400 --> 00:16:18,750
The miraculous Cesare ... twenty-three years old , he has slept for twenty-three years ... Continuously ...

43
00:16:18,850 --> 00:16:46,080
Right before your eyes Cesare will awaken from his death-like trance ...

44
00:17:24,810 --> 00:17:28,200
The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari

45
00:18:45,300 --> 00:18:58,450
Cesare ! Can you hear me ? Cesare , I am calling you ...

46
00:18:58,550 --> 00:19:11,770
I ... Dr. Caligari ... your master ... Awaken for a moment from your dark night ...

47
00:20:46,700 --> 00:21:01,759
Ladies and gentlemen ! Cesare the Somnambulist will answer all your questions ...

48
00:21:01,927 --> 00:21:20,194
Cesare knows every secret ... Cesare knows the past and sees the future ...

49
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:35,459
Judge for yourselves ... Don 't hold back ! Ask away ...

50
00:22:03,113 --> 00:22:09,577
How long will I live ?

51
00:22:21,882 --> 00:22:24,342
Till the break of dawn ...

52
00:23:15,350 --> 00:23:21,690
Murder in Holstenwall 1000 Marks Reward

53
00:24:42,189 --> 00:24:46,150
The way home

54
00:25:04,211 --> 00:25:10,966
Alan , we both love her ...

55
00:25:21,144 --> 00:25:26,065
We 'll leave the choice up to her ...

56
00:25:26,191 --> 00:25:35,866
But whomever she chooses , we shall remain friends ...

57
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:53,300
Night

58
00:26:24,500 --> 00:26:28,150
END OF ACT II

59
00:26:28,630 --> 00:26:32,006
ACT III

60
00:27:02,370 --> 00:27:11,253
Mr. Franzis ... Mr. Franzis ... Mr. Alan is dead ... murdered .

61
00:28:25,570 --> 00:28:33,669
The somnambulist 's prophecy ? !

62
00:29:29,100 --> 00:29:40,861
I won 't rest until I get to the bottom of these dreadful deeds .

63
00:32:48,180 --> 00:33:02,771
I will obtain police authorisation to examine the somnambulist ...

64
00:33:47,483 --> 00:33:50,152
Murder ... Help ... Murder !

65
00:37:18,569 --> 00:37:22,739
Wake him up !

66
00:37:40,380 --> 00:37:55,360
Special Edition : Holstenwall Mystery Solved ! Two-Time Murderer Caught In Third Attempt !

67
00:38:29,265 --> 00:38:31,599
END OF ACT III

68
00:38:32,310 --> 00:38:35,770
ACT IV

69
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:46,614
Worried because her father has been away so long ...

70
00:39:28,950 --> 00:39:39,292
I had nothing to do with the two murders ... So help me God ...

71
00:39:47,870 --> 00:39:56,726
The old woman ... It 's true ... I tried to kill her ...

72
00:39:56,850 --> 00:40:15,540
by stabbing her in the side with a similar knife to throw suspicion on the mysterious murderer

73
00:41:25,649 --> 00:41:34,908
Is my father ... Dr. Olfen here ?

74
00:43:18,150 --> 00:43:24,892
After the funeral

75
00:43:46,600 --> 00:43:50,585
Night

76
00:49:50,930 --> 00:49:52,580
Cesare ... !

77
00:50:08,560 --> 00:50:16,387
It couldn 't have been Cesare ...

78
00:50:16,513 --> 00:50:25,104
He was asleep at the time ... I 've watched him for hours ...

79
00:50:49,600 --> 00:50:52,673
END OF ACT IV

80
00:50:53,220 --> 00:50:56,550
ACT V

81
00:51:33,450 --> 00:51:40,450
Is the prisoner secure in his cell ?

82
00:51:51,850 --> 00:51:56,240
I must see him ...

83
00:54:42,050 --> 00:54:51,200
Lunatic Asylum

84
00:55:17,050 --> 00:55:22,276
Do you have a patient by the name of Dr. Caligari ?

85
00:55:54,768 --> 00:56:05,110
The director returned earlier today ... perhaps you should speak to him personally ...

86
00:57:12,200 --> 00:57:19,726
He ... himself ... and none other ... is Caligari ...

87
00:57:35,660 --> 00:57:47,880
While the director , now placed under observation , is sleeping in his villa ...

88
00:57:56,830 --> 00:57:58,974
He 's asleep .

89
00:58:43,770 --> 00:58:46,313
Somnambulism

90
00:58:46,439 --> 00:58:51,109
A Collected Edition by the University of Upsala published in 1726

91
00:58:53,000 --> 00:58:56,156
His specialty

92
00:59:15,969 --> 00:59:19,888
The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari

93
00:59:20,056 --> 00:59:24,977
In the year 1783 , a mystic by the name of Caligari

94
00:59:25,144 --> 00:59:30,941
Toured the fairs of numerous villages in northern Italy ,

95
00:59:31,067 --> 00:59:35,737
Accompanied by a somnambulist named Cesare .

96
00:59:41,190 --> 00:59:56,000
For months he sowed panic amongst village folks through a series of foul murders committed under almost identical circumstances

97
01:00:15,361 --> 01:00:22,659
He had entirely subjugated to his will a somnambulist named Cesare ,

98
01:00:22,785 --> 01:00:30,917
Whom he did compel to carry out his nefarious schemes .

99
01:00:31,085 --> 01:00:38,717
A puppet , the exact likeness of Cesare , and which took his place in a cabinet ,

100
01:00:38,843 --> 01:00:48,602
Allowed him to divert any suspicion that might fall on the somnambulist .

101
01:00:53,450 --> 01:00:55,901
My diary

102
01:01:02,900 --> 01:01:14,461
12 March ... Finally ... finally ! a somnambulist has been brought to the asylum for admission

103
01:02:58,983 --> 01:03:06,700
Afternoon ... my desire ... I shall be able to satisfy my life 's unwavering wish !

104
01:03:06,783 --> 01:03:13,121
Now I shall unravel the psychiatric secrets of this Caligari ! now I shall discover if it is true

105
01:03:16,650 --> 01:03:30,650
that a somnambulist can be compelled to perform acts that in a walking state he would never commit and would be repugnant to him

106
01:03:30,710 --> 01:03:39,314
Whether it is true that a sleepwalker can be led to commit even murder ...

107
01:03:55,164 --> 01:03:57,499
An obsession

108
01:04:27,400 --> 01:04:39,499
I must know everything ... I must penetrate his secrets . I must become Caligari ...

109
01:05:03,107 --> 01:05:09,613
You Must Become Caligari

110
01:05:49,862 --> 01:05:53,198
END OF ACT V

111
01:05:53,800 --> 01:05:57,243
ACT VI

112
01:06:39,286 --> 01:06:46,584
We found the sleepwalker out in the fields ...

113
01:08:05,320 --> 01:08:13,505
Mr. Director - unmask yourself . You are Dr. Caligari !

114
01:10:58,720 --> 01:11:10,807
... And from that day on , the madman never again left his cell .

115
01:12:27,400 --> 01:12:38,780
Look ... there 's Cesare ... never allow him to tell your fortune , or you 're dead ...

116
01:13:13,380 --> 01:13:23,481
Jane ... I love you ... won 't you be my wife at last ?

117
01:13:32,100 --> 01:13:41,457
We queens are not free to answer the call of our heart ...

118
01:14:20,330 --> 01:14:25,585
You all think that ... I 'm insane !

119
01:14:25,711 --> 01:14:32,175
It isn 't true ... It 's the director who 's insane !

120
01:14:37,000 --> 01:14:40,600
He is Caligari ... Caligari ... Caligari !

121
01:15:51,000 --> 01:15:59,428
At last I understand his delusion . he thinks I am that mystic , Caligari ! now I know exactly how to cure him ...

122
01:16:13,277 --> 01:16:16,445
THE END

123
01:16:17,050 --> 01:16:30,700
